{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "171", "x": 0.9003897281068982, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.0333535204967375, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 4", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.07868870942920975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Design and Technology Lecturer: It's only relatively recently that designers", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7718470680375074, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "have become aware of the need to be inclusive when designing products. But", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7721018425477123, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "what does that mean exactly? Well, it simply means designing products", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7767252053395406, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that span economic, social, and cultural barriers. It means making sure", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7713260362222712, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "products are accessible so that as many different types of people as", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7715219614089922, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "possible can use them without any type of adaptation having to be made to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7716574993979222, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the original design.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.2042855584477845, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Inclusive design is often linked with universal design although they are not", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7713695068026845, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "quite the same thing. Universal design aims to make products that work for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "everyone and that includes considering the needs of people who have", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7718084161299229, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cognitive difficulties which can present quite a challenge.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.5946134619570393, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Today, examples of successful inclusive design can be seen all around us.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.7586933215142566, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In workplaces, it is common to see desks which can be adjusted to suit", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7713044034570185, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people of different heights or for wheelchair users. This still isn't always the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3882917173327837, "w": 0.7717321375642922, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "case, however, and is one reason why office workers often suffer from back", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "or neck problems.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.19198963821301876, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "You'll find another example in the public toilets of countless hotels, airports,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44495241748105896, "w": 0.7717178865957133, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and offices. Taps that you activate by sensor require no pressing or twisting", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4637898773586998, "w": 0.7769392774430851, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "movements. These are not only more hygienic, they're also easier for people", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.7717397244108737, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with dexterity or mobility issues.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5016379005842139, "w": 0.3393389888148351, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The tech industry has been criticized in the past for focusing too much on", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5204753604618547, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "young consumers, but this is changing. Many products are now designed", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.7715218588840385, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with the elderly in mind.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5582986384538816, "w": 0.2528644703155913, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "For example, it's well known that vision declines with age and that we also", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5771360983315225, "w": 0.7713478740374317, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "become worse at distinguishing between similar colors, in particular shades", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5959735582091633, "w": 0.7768337792656199, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of blue, which is why software designers rarely create interfaces with this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.771661292821213, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "color.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6337967984797978, "w": 0.06716601958042073, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Motor skills also decline with age, and some people have difficulty doing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6526343338002236, "w": 0.7712608303516514, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "everyday things like picking up a cup or opening a door. This can also affect", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6715088360853101, "w": 0.7715870647546583, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their ability to use a mouse or keyboard. So, voice access is now a routine", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6904946164783037, "w": 0.7714135925328205, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "way of making commands.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7093321517987295, "w": 0.2788672848306231, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It's worth looking at the problems non-inclusive designs cause when not", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7281696116763704, "w": 0.7718233847731784, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "enough consideration is given to a range of users as it can have a serious", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7470070715540112, "w": 0.7714350202481658, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "impact on people's lives.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7659929273897897, "w": 0.2587100587129653, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Access is one obvious example because it has such a huge impact on", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7848303872674306, "w": 0.7763983557868108, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "disabled people's independence. Not being able to access public transport", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8036678471450714, "w": 0.771609312669634, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "because buses or trains are not wheelchair friendly means many disabled", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.822653627538065, "w": 0.7715653294644517, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people can't go out unless someone goes with them.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8414910874157059, "w": 0.5361071357060273, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Safety is another issue. Inexplicably, most cars are still crash tested using a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8791907524044748, "w": 0.7714567555383723, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dummy based on an average-sized male. This has safety implications for all", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8981765327974682, "w": 0.7716309454348868, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "women, particularly those who are pregnant, as the seat belts worn by the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9170139926751091, "w": 0.7715439017491065, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dummy are not adapted to accommodate them.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.935851527995535, "w": 0.4905518128821169, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}